	measure _weightedaccuracylag2 = ```
			
			
			SUMX(
			    SUMMARIZE(
			        'TEST EDB LAG FCST',
			        'TEST EDB LAG FCST'[Customer Groups],
			        'DIM Product'[SKU & Desc],
			        'TEST EDB LAG FCST'[MonthStartDate]
			    ),
			    CALCULATE(
			        [_LAG 2 Forecast Accuracy %] * [_salesweight]
			    )
			)
			
			```
